    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The world has two ways of saying no to change. You learn one of them today.</em></p><p><strong>On gaining Bulwark Initiation 1 you receive:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>Athletics (Violence)</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>Melee</strong> and <strong>Plating</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>+30 Violence marks</strong> to your Domain's cap, and <strong>20 marks of free siege works</strong> folded into the buffer every time your Domain opens or joins a Siege.</p></li><li><p>You bank <strong>Surge</strong> by eating the blow: +1 Surge each time you take Integrity damage (max +2 a round). Spend it from the ◆ Surge menu.</p></li></ul><p>Your Path's L1 feature shapes how you bank it.</p>",
